# Review-package diffs are derived data: each is byte-identical to
#   git diff <base>..<head>
# for the SHAs in its filename (verified 2026-07-25 by regenerating one and
# comparing). They are regenerable from git history and would add ~800K of
# duplication, so they stay untracked.
#
# The markdown IS tracked. The briefs, per-task reports, fix-round reports and
# progress.md are the reasoning record behind every ruling on this branch, and
# they exist nowhere else -- a `git clean -fdx` used to destroy all of it.
*.diff
